    <name>Kura target platform PDE dependencies</name>

    <!--
        Direct deps below cover every P2 bundle that p2-repo-{equinox,extra,common}
        produces under groupId=p2.osgi.bundle in ~/.m2 — generated by reficio +
        target-platform/install-to-m2.sh. Listing them as direct deps lets a
        Maven location in any kura.target file resolve them via ~/.m2 alone, with
        no Profile location and no hardcoded /Users/... path. Adopting this layout
        from upstream eclipse-kura/kura made the .target files portable across
        clones and developers.

        Sibling repos (kura-{management-ui,networking,opcua}) reuse this artifact
        in their target-definition's Maven location.

        org.eclipse.milo and com.digitalpetri.* are intentionally absent — they
        are opcua-exclusive and live in the kura-opcua sibling's
        target-platform/p2-repo-opcua-deps reficio.

        Versions are inlined (rather than relying on target-platform-bom
        dependencyManagement) so a fresh clone can resolve without first having
        to reason about which BOM scopes apply.
    -->

